<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing restarted as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing restarted as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Tuesday it reinitiated coverage of Boeing Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/8 to 58-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
